## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of cross-region coherence, stampede prevention, and combined Redis/Memcached strategies.

## Key Concepts
- Distributed cache invalidation across regions
- Versioned keys and pub/sub invalidations
- Read-through vs write-through choices
- Dead-letter handling for partition faults

## Code Example
```javascript
// Update path
const ver = await redis.incr(`res:${id}:ver`);
await redis.publish(`cache:invalidate:${id}`, ver);

// Read path
let [value, verCached] = memcache.get(`res:${id}:val`);
const currentVer = await redis.get(`res:${id}:ver`);
if (verCached !== currentVer) {
  value = fetchFromSourceAndUpdateCaches(id, currentVer);
  memcache.set(`res:${id}:val`, value);
}
```

